event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":86,"item_id":"rs_0fe0be7442e653f8016acae758172c87d2ba685245b08fc22c","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating task management processes**\n\nI'm thinking about how to manage tasks effectively. It seems I might need to append edits and test filters by inserting before certain entries. I should ensure that any deletion of tasks follows priorities and maintains saved notes. It's important to check that tasks marked as completed appear correctly, even when deletions occur. Also, when creating tasks, I'd want to set their status accurately. I need a clear strategy for handling this!"}

